<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor Inc upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Centocor Inc upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co said it raised Centocor Inc to trading buy from neutral.</p>
<p>-- Centocor gained 1-3/8 to 34-7/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
